<title>UK: Shell, Cairn in Bangaldesh, Indian oil alliance.</title>
<headline>Shell, Cairn in Bangaldesh, Indian oil alliance.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shell Exploration B.V., a unit of the Royal Dutch/Shell Group and Cairn Energy PLC said on Tuesday they have agreed in principle to an alliance combining their oil and gas exploration and production activities in Bangladesh and areas of India.</p>
</text>
